From d493d843ce300c75f6961b4212a7ddb5935c8ca4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Max Weiss <maxweiss@microsoft.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 03:48:46 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] Stage hotplug volume handoffs

Adapt the retained-only handoff to the released controller APIs. Preserve
every useful running fallback, keep incoming claims out of intermediate
helper status, and retain guest-unmount and terminating-holder guards.
Cover reciprocal moves and automatic convergence after modeled 18- and
45-minute CSI delays.

Rebase insertion context onto Azure Linux's existing fallback-cleanup
backport without changing the implementation or regression tests.

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
